  "description": "<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>SA&Eacute;A is a woman-of-color-owned business focused on creating handcrafted, sustainable natural stone home decor. Each piece is a reflection of timeless craftsmanship and organic minimalism, with a deep commitment to sustainability and social impact. We donate a % of profits to humanitarian organizations, ensuring that our designs contribute to both the environment and society.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>Our collection includes home goods such as candleholders, bowls, and vases, all crafted from unique, untreated natural stone like onyx. The beauty of each product is enhanced by the raw, organic texture of the stone, highlighting its natural variations and making every item a one-of-a-kind piece.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>SA&Eacute;A products stand out due to their focus on sustainability and craftsmanship. We create durable, minimalist pieces that connect consumers with nature, made without plastics or synthetics. Each design celebrates the beauty of imperfections and natural materials, offering an environmentally-conscious alternative to mass-produced decor.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>Affiliates earn a commission on sales generated through their unique referral links. Commissions will be paid monthly via PayPal.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>We prioritize long-term relationships with our affiliates.</li>\r\n<li>Affiliates will receive exclusive access to product launches and promotional materials.</li>\r\n<li>For any questions or support, our affiliate team is available via email.</li>\r\n</ul>",
